  "prefLabel": "Fis 1109.15 Legal Name",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1109.15 Legal Name. Whenever an applicant’s name is required by statute or rule, the applicant shall provide his or her legal first name and last name.\n\nSource. #13874, eff 2-23-24",
